          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of the appearance of two constant glowing balls moving silently and at the same speed, followed by two more balls: observation of celestial lanterns.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "9a370e0d65fc96b1171993ad0b74371bb242eeb4ece0c02805334157e2572843"
